### Serving the Example over HTTP
[folder] @(70, 155) {$note, w=1140px, size=28px} In `web/Lectures/hypotenuse`, keep these files together:
[files] @(70, 225) {$code, w=1140px, size=25px} ```text
hypotenuse.wat     hypotenuse.wasm     hypotenuse.html
```
