python3 -m http.server 8000 --bind 127.0.0.1
```
[url] @(70, 455) {$note, w=1140px, size=30px, color=emp} Open [http://localhost:8000/hypotenuse.html](http://localhost:8000/hypotenuse.html).
[why] @(70, 540) {$note, w=1140px, size=27px} Use the HTTP URL so `fetch` can load the Wasm file. Leave the server running.
[stop] @(70, 625) {$note, w=1140px, size=25px, color=id} Stop the server with Ctrl-C when you finish.
