### Loading Wasm in JavaScript
[fetch] @(70, 180) {$code, w=760px, size=23px, pad=6px} ```javascript
fetch('hypotenuse.wasm');
```
[explain] @(870, 180) {$note, w=330px, size=27px, color=explain} fetch starts the request and returns a Promise.
...
