[await] @(70, 180) {$code, w=760px, size=23px, pad=6px} ```javascript
await fetch('hypotenuse.wasm');
```
!anim explain text await waits for the response inside an async function.
...
!anim await hide 0.15s
[js0] @(70, 180) {$code, w=760px, size=21px, pad=6px} ```javascript
const wasm_file = await fetch('hypotenuse.wasm');
```
!anim explain text Keep the response object.
...
[js1] @(70, 235) {$code, w=760px, size=21px, pad=6px} ```javascript
const buffer = await wasm_file.arrayBuffer();
```
!anim explain text Read the response body as binary bytes.
...
[js2] @(70, 290) {$code, w=760px, size=21px, pad=6px} ```javascript
const module = await WebAssembly.instantiate(buffer);
```
!anim explain text Compile and instantiate the Wasm module.
...
[js3] @(70, 345) {$code, w=760px, size=21px, pad=6px} ```javascript
const { CalcHypotenuse } = module.instance.exports;
```
!anim explain text Get the exported function by name.
...
[js4] @(70, 400) {$code, w=760px, size=21px, pad=6px} ```javascript
const x = 3.0; const y = 4.0;
```
!anim explain text Choose the two side lengths.
...
[js5] @(70, 455) {$code, w=760px, size=21px, pad=6px} ```javascript
