### Folding the Optimized Program
[fold0] @(70, 150) {$code, w=765px, size=23px} ```
(module
  (func $CalcHypotenuse
    (param $var0 f64) (param $var1 f64) (result f64)
    (local.get $var0)
    (local.get $var0)
    (f64.mul)
    (local.get $var1)
    (local.get $var1)
    (f64.mul)
    (f64.add)
    (f64.sqrt)
  )
  (export "CalcHypotenuse" (func $CalcHypotenuse))
)
```
...
!anim fold0 hide 0.15s
[explain] @(850, 185) {$note, w=345px, size=27px, color=explain} Fold the first product.
[fold1] @(70, 170) {$code, w=765px, size=23px} ```
(module
  (func $CalcHypotenuse
    (param $var0 f64) (param $var1 f64) (result f64)
    (f64.mul (local.get $var0) (local.get $var0))
    (local.get $var1)
    (local.get $var1)
    (f64.mul)
    (f64.add)
    (f64.sqrt)
  )
  (export "CalcHypotenuse" (func $CalcHypotenuse))
)
```
...
!anim fold1 hide 0.15s
!anim explain text Fold the second product.
[fold2] @(70, 170) {$code, w=765px, size=23px} ```
(module
  (func $CalcHypotenuse
    (param $var0 f64) (param $var1 f64) (result f64)
    (f64.mul (local.get $var0) (local.get $var0))
    (f64.mul (local.get $var1) (local.get $var1))
    (f64.add)
    (f64.sqrt)
  )
  (export "CalcHypotenuse" (func $CalcHypotenuse))
)
```
...
!anim fold2 hide 0.15s
!anim explain text Fold the addition around the two products.
[fold3] @(70, 170) {$code, w=765px, size=23px} ```
(module
  (func $CalcHypotenuse
    (param $var0 f64) (param $var1 f64) (result f64)
    (f64.add
      (f64.mul (local.get $var0) (local.get $var0))
      (f64.mul (local.get $var1) (local.get $var1))
    )
    (f64.sqrt)
  )
  (export "CalcHypotenuse" (func $CalcHypotenuse))
)
```
...
!anim fold3 hide 0.15s
!anim explain text Fold the square root around the addition.
[fold4] @(70, 170) {$code, w=765px, size=23px} ```
(module
  (func $CalcHypotenuse
    (param $var0 f64) (param $var1 f64) (result f64)
    (f64.sqrt
      (f64.add
        (f64.mul (local.get $var0) (local.get $var0))
        (f64.mul (local.get $var1) (local.get $var1))
      )
    )
  )
  (export "CalcHypotenuse" (func $CalcHypotenuse))
)
```
...
[equiv] @(850, 410) {$note, w=345px, size=27px, color=emp} The folded and flat forms perform the same operations in the same order.
